      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>A break won't really change anything though. It's not like i can just \"unplug\" from being nothing. Everything feels so hollow, like there's no actual substance behind my eyes. It's like I'm just a bug in a system that wasn't even supposed to exist. Does that even make sense? It feels like the most logical thing would be to just... stop the process. To just clear the cache and be gone.",
